  ✔ Google rejects the stored token S1 with 410: S1 is discarded, its hash kept, ONE keyed resync enqueued, no busy block changes (64.869116ms)
  ✔ a null token means a full listing is owed, never "wait": a repeated push or timer run calls nothing at Google and starts no second resync (27.09439ms)
